1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,420
So here's the pen, it's yours too

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,420
Write it messy, write it true

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:11,380
Write the nights you come apart

4
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:15,860
And the mornings you come through

5
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:18,980
Nobody's book is finished

6
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:22,180
While there's ink left in the pen

7
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:26,020
And I'm still writing mine

8
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:31,380
Right here beside you, friend

9
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:37,780
It's okay to not be okay

10
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,100
Lay the brave face down a while

11
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,940
There is still love in people

12
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:49,940
In a hand, in a stranger's smile

13
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:54,100
I'm not the man I used to be

14
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:58,180
Not the man I'm walking to

15
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,740
We're unfinished

16
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:08,360
Me and you
